1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:04,510
It appears that you're the last one.

2
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:08,190
Damn it! You damn brats...
Who do you think you are?!

3
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,410
Dust Cyclone!

4
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:10,610
Flamethrower!

5
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:13,570
Combo Attack! Telekinetic Pillar of Flame!

6
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:16,120
Don't underestimate me! This is nothing—

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,330
Good job, you two.

8
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,540
You've gotten stronger.

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,660
We've been practicing every day.

10
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,630
It's all thanks to your guidance, Teru-san.

11
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,940
Thank you for helping us, Takeuchi-san.

12
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:32,470
No need to thank me.
I left the organization as well.

13
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:35,760
I acted like I betrayed you so we could
pull off a splendid surprise attack.

14
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:40,240
You better be grateful for me
and my peerless wit.

15
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,410
What? H-Huh? I can't move...

16
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,190
Kaito-kun.

17
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:47,050
Lie-Detection Telepathy!

18
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,880
It's okay. He hasn't betrayed us yet.

19
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,350
What do you mean, "yet"?!

20
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:54,360
So what are we going to do now?

21
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,690
Reigen-san said we didn't have to fight,

22
00:00:57,690 --> 00:00:59,400
but I disagree.

23
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:01,980
We're going to take our city back.

24
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:09,380
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

25
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:12,190
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

26
00:01:12,190 --> 00:01:15,040
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

27
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,100
(Get ready!)

28
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,690
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

29
00:01:22,750 --> 00:01:27,430
You're a MOB. Can't you feel your own frustration?

30
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:33,180
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

31
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:37,740
You're a MOB. What do you want to be?

32
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:44,280
Wear your overflowing emotions on your sleeve and break it down.

33
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:49,180
What do you see once you go beyond your limits?

34
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:52,160
(99.9! 99.9!)

35
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:55,040
The mysterious percentage.

36
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:59,510
Cryin' my life, cryin' my psyche,

37
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:02,460
cryin' my heart in such commonplaces!

38
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:05,290
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

39
00:02:05,290 --> 00:02:08,200
It all begins when it hits 100.

40
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:10,990
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

41
00:02:10,990 --> 00:02:13,880
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

42
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:18,270
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind? Right now...

43
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:20,810
Your life is your own.

44
00:02:20,810 --> 00:02:23,580
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

45
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:28,090
Mob Psycho

46
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:26,470
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

47
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:29,340
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

48
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:30,650
(Get ready!)

49
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,130
Guidance
~Psychic Sensor~

50
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:39,700
You pathetic dogs...

51
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:45,010
You've forgotten how terrifying your owner
can be because I left you alone for a bit.

52
00:02:46,550 --> 00:02:47,740
Sho is here.

53
00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:50,060
Okay, let's go.

54
00:02:50,060 --> 00:02:51,020
Say, Ritsu.

55
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:54,110
Why are you being so cooperative?

56
00:02:55,410 --> 00:02:58,930
Because your situation wasn't
completely unrelatable.

57
00:02:59,550 --> 00:03:04,700
There are times when I worry what'd happen
if Nii-san went berserk with his powers.

58
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:08,290
And Suzuki, your father is
going berserk right now.

59
00:03:08,670 --> 00:03:11,440
You're the only one who can stop him.

60
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:15,470
Yeah! I'll show you that I can finish this!

61
00:03:16,690 --> 00:03:17,880
There you are,

62
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,340
Shimazaki!

63
00:03:19,650 --> 00:03:21,040
I can tell at a glance...

64
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,740
He's really strong!

65
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:26,320
He's a teleporter that can
read his enemy's movements.

66
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:26,980
First, I'll—

67
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:28,350
You go on ahead.

68
00:03:28,530 --> 00:03:30,680
I'll keep him occupied.

69
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,730
You can't deal with him alone.

70
00:03:32,730 --> 00:03:34,880
He's one of the strongest
in the whole organization.

71
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,020
And that's exactly why.

72
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:39,740
In return, promise me that
you'll stop your father.

73
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:43,880
I promise. I'm glad to have you around.

74
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:44,950
Go!

75
00:03:58,170 --> 00:03:59,280
He got away?

76
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,310
He doesn't intend to follow Suzuki?

77
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:13,770
I'm over here.

78
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:18,480
I'd appreciate it if you
wouldn't resist so much.

79
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:21,190
I don't exactly like beating on weaklings.

80
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:23,650
You're just as weak!

81
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:28,620
Oh? And who are you comparing me to?

82
00:04:33,910 --> 00:04:37,080
I should've taken him out
before it got to this point.

83
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:40,500
I'd just been powerless to do anything
but sit back and watch...

84
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:42,300
This is it for you.

85
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:45,090
Such a shame. You managed to get this far...

86
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:46,510
But now, you have to deal with me.

87
00:04:46,670 --> 00:04:48,970
My dad is using his powers for evil,

88
00:04:48,970 --> 00:04:51,950
but I'm going to use my powers
to show him what's right!

89
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:55,320
I'm going to end this!

90
00:04:57,220 --> 00:05:00,650
How awful. Someone used
psychic powers to do this?

91
00:05:00,650 --> 00:05:02,650
That's the enemy base.

92
00:05:02,830 --> 00:05:04,900
Reigen and the others should
be heading over, too.

93
00:05:06,110 --> 00:05:09,800
Hey, there's still some brat here.
Did he wait too long to run away?

94
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,580
Whoo! Got us some dinner.

95
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:12,800
So they're pillaging the area.

96
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:15,960
I've gone there with Ritsu before.

97
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,540
Return what you took from the store.
Stealing is a crime.

98
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:19,710
You're supposed to be adults.

99
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:21,230
Who the hell are you?

100
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:26,470
This town belongs to us now.

101
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:30,020
Yo, stop. You're gonna traumatize him.

102
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:32,560
Stop messing around with your powers.

103
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,430
Don't use them like this.

104
00:05:34,590 --> 00:05:35,390
Stop.

105
00:05:37,350 --> 00:05:40,720
I-Is this kid a natural esper?

106
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:44,530
Could you guys manufacture this can?

107
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,680
Huh?

108
00:05:46,090 --> 00:05:49,270
Could you actually grow
the vegetables in this sandwich?

109
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:53,740
Could you fix that glass door you just broke?

110
00:05:54,110 --> 00:05:58,210
Could your powers help you hit upon the idea
of giving out a freebie for a lucky draw?

111
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,880
The hell are you trying to say?

112
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,350
You guys are making a huge mistake,

113
00:06:03,350 --> 00:06:06,480
thinking you're special
just because of your powers.

114
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:11,100
You should realize that you're only able to
survive thanks to the help of others.

115
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:14,890
You fool! You can make anyone submit
to you as long as you have power!

116
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:19,090
One last thing... Don't use your
physic powers against others.

117
00:06:19,530 --> 00:06:22,350
If you don't have anyone
who can give you that advice,

118
00:06:22,350 --> 00:06:23,540
I'll do it.

119
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:29,110
Holy crap, he's pissed. I'm gonna get back.

120
00:06:29,610 --> 00:06:30,740
An attack by the enemy?

121
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:32,270
Gather everyone up!

122
00:06:32,570 --> 00:06:33,580
Well, well...

123
00:06:33,930 --> 00:06:37,090
Looks like we had quite the stray show up.

124
00:06:37,090 --> 00:06:38,290
Minegishi-san!

125
00:06:38,670 --> 00:06:41,170
I'll take him down.
You guys back me up.

126
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:49,590
These will grow as much as I'd like
if I give them my power,

127
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:54,270
and multiply as much as I'd like.

128
00:06:59,410 --> 00:07:01,150
You can do it, too?

129
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:04,730
You don't really like plants, do you?

130
00:07:04,730 --> 00:07:06,940
That's right. They're merely tools.

131
00:07:10,590 --> 00:07:12,350
Go! Drop him!

132
00:07:13,590 --> 00:07:15,120
Help Minegishi-san out!

133
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,140
Hit him with your telekinesis!

134
00:07:21,010 --> 00:07:23,500
It's better to bend than break.

135
00:07:23,890 --> 00:07:26,050
You should join our side.

136
00:07:28,350 --> 00:07:32,630
That might be easier, but it's no fun.

137
00:07:34,660 --> 00:07:37,310
You should see the difference
in our abilities by now.

138
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:41,270
You sure you won't change your mind
if I hurt you a bit more?

139
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:45,370
I always wanted to be able
to use psychic powers.

140
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:49,620
But now that I've finally awakened to
these powers, I finally understand...

141
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:55,120
To shed blood, sweat, and tears
in order to live a fun life...

142
00:07:55,600 --> 00:08:00,250
What I really wanted was
that kind of wholehearted devotion.

143
00:08:01,330 --> 00:08:04,670
I won't let anyone take away
my ability to live a fun life!

144
00:08:05,470 --> 00:08:08,000
Guess you might not be a good fit, after all.

145
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:10,370
In that case, I'll just...

146
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:15,760
Ow...

147
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:18,010
I managed to land a hit for the first time!

148
00:08:18,330 --> 00:08:21,030
My, my, you're far more
resilient than I'd imagined.

149
00:08:21,030 --> 00:08:22,980
We need to repay you for
what you did earlier.

150
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,860
I guess you're not sewer rats.
You're cockroaches.

151
00:08:27,030 --> 00:08:29,160
We've changed since we were in Claw.

152
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:33,490
Now that we want independence,
we're far more resilient.

153
00:08:33,490 --> 00:08:35,960
The results won't change,
no matter how many times you try.

154
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:38,580
Don't act so tough.
We know you're panicking.

155
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:40,450
Even if you can read our moves,

156
00:08:40,450 --> 00:08:42,710
you should hit your limit
with so many people.

157
00:08:43,410 --> 00:08:45,350
I'll be getting my revenge!

158
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:49,840
Takeuchi!

159
00:08:54,170 --> 00:08:55,010
Tsuchiya!

160
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,930
Not happening!

161
00:09:10,690 --> 00:09:12,220
Aren't you going to shoot?

162
00:09:21,170 --> 00:09:23,870
I don't think capture tactics
will be of much use.

163
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:30,130
I told you...

164
00:09:30,130 --> 00:09:32,670
Cleaning

165
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:32,670
The result won't change, no matter
how many of you there are.

166
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:40,540
Attack more!

167
00:09:40,540 --> 00:09:41,600
The more moves we make,

168
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,020
we can figure out where
he'll teleport and finish him!

169
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,550
They're far more capable than
those people in the division...

170
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:52,980
Don't stop, Shigeo!

171
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:57,320
All right! He's panicking!
Let's hit him some more!

172
00:09:59,660 --> 00:10:01,580
Looks like you're having some trouble.

173
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:02,280
You're...

174
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:05,040
I wouldn't mind lending you my support.

175
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:08,340
Now, go!

176
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:11,890
It's Matsuo, the evil-spirit user!

177
00:10:11,890 --> 00:10:14,290
He's gonna send all kinds of monsters at us!

178
00:10:17,230 --> 00:10:19,510
I'd appreciate it if you
wouldn't underestimate me...

179
00:10:21,010 --> 00:10:22,100
Matsuo-san!

180
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:25,770
What's this small bottle?

181
00:10:26,090 --> 00:10:27,810
Talk about bad taste.

182
00:10:27,810 --> 00:10:29,900
N-No, anything but that!

183
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:32,860
Even I can't control it! Don't touch it!

184
00:10:33,090 --> 00:10:36,820
You dumbass! We have Minegishi-san!

185
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,770
Wh-What? Why's everyone falling...

186
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:49,370
What... is that?

187
00:10:49,830 --> 00:10:51,080
Mogami-san!

188
00:10:51,710 --> 00:10:52,790
This isn't good.

189
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,750
What is that?

190
00:10:57,120 --> 00:11:01,430
So, after the poison jar, you now want me
to devour a horde of espers...

191
00:11:02,210 --> 00:11:04,490
You're such lowly creatures...

192
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:09,390
Wh-What the hell is that?!

193
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:14,820
My plants aren't listening to me!

194
00:11:18,490 --> 00:11:21,990
Mob Psycho

195
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:21,990
Winner

196
00:11:21,990 --> 00:11:25,490
Mob Psycho

197
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:25,490
Wi

198
00:11:31,210 --> 00:11:32,320
Stop!

199
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:33,920
Why are you trying to stop me?

200
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:37,630
I've been watching, and none of
these insects deserve to live.

201
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:41,090
There are humans that never change.

202
00:11:41,090 --> 00:11:43,300
But... they might be able to change!

203
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:45,930
Promise that you won't do
anything bad ever again!

204
00:11:46,300 --> 00:11:49,270
I promise... Spare me...

205
00:11:49,510 --> 00:11:50,530
See?!

206
00:11:50,530 --> 00:11:53,350
What if he's just lying so he can survive?

207
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:57,860
Are you going to watch over them
until they've reformed?

208
00:11:58,550 --> 00:12:00,910
You think you can keep an eye on them forever?

209
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:04,760
Well... no.

210
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:08,080
But we need to have faith in one another
in order to get through life.

211
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:11,790
If we can't do that,
we'll never get anywhere.

212
00:12:12,950 --> 00:12:14,750
I'd expect nothing less from you.

213
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:19,380
But there are things that can't
be solved with mere kindness.

214
00:12:19,770 --> 00:12:22,720
It's also necessary to be
hard on people at times.

215
00:12:23,500 --> 00:12:28,460
If you can do that, you will be invincible,
Kageyama Shigeo-kun.

216
00:12:31,890 --> 00:12:35,650
Did Mogami disappear
for good this time, or...?

217
00:12:35,930 --> 00:12:38,090
Be hard on people, huh?

218
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,680
I'm not very good at that.

219
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:46,000
I'm here now. Claw is finished!

220
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:49,480
Sho, there must've been a
better way of doing this.

221
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,910
We're family.

222
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:53,430
What? Now you want to act like a father?

223
00:12:53,430 --> 00:12:56,130
You never cared about a damn thing I said.

224
00:12:56,350 --> 00:12:59,880
You should've attacked while
playing the obedient son.

225
00:13:00,830 --> 00:13:02,840
Don't get in my way any further.

226
00:13:03,290 --> 00:13:05,700
It took me twenty years to get here.

227
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:09,600
Serves you right! I've ruined
those twenty years for you!

228
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:12,390
I'm just as strong as the Ultimate 5 now!

229
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:14,600
Fight me, man to man!

230
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,060
Don't make me laugh.

231
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:19,270
Never look down on your father.

232
00:13:19,780 --> 00:13:22,870
A stupidly powerful barrier that
activates when I try to get close...

233
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:25,430
Is that your true power?

234
00:13:25,430 --> 00:13:26,400
In that case...

235
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:35,750
Damn it... He's mocking me!

236
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:40,010
These techniques are mere child's play.

237
00:13:41,390 --> 00:13:44,630
I thought you would've grown
a little more than that.

238
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:51,200
Oh? You've learned how to mess with
the refraction factor of light?

239
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:53,330
This is my trump card!

240
00:13:53,330 --> 00:13:55,310
Here's the energy I've saved up
over three months...

241
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:57,520
Charge Bomb!

242
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:03,000
Hell, yeah! Justice prevails!

243
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:09,660
I'm so sorry. I wouldn't have taken a
bathroom break if I'd known this'd happen.

244
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:10,780
That's fine.

245
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:13,240
My son's just going through
his rebellious phase.

246
00:14:13,430 --> 00:14:15,270
Being a bad boy again?

247
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:17,500
You'll never turn out to be
a decent adult like that.

248
00:14:17,690 --> 00:14:20,960
Screw you! That was three
months' worth of energy!

249
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:25,170
Let's stop fighting and happily
take over the world together.

250
00:14:25,170 --> 00:14:27,030
Don't bother.

251
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:30,010
I can see why Sho would disagree with this.

252
00:14:30,450 --> 00:14:35,100
You fear this plan will fail, don't you?
You don't know the outside world, after all.

253
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:38,560
The real reason I went around the world

254
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:42,610
was to see if world domination
would actually be realistic.

255
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:48,170
But ultimately, I couldn't find a single
esper stronger than me in this world.

256
00:14:48,170 --> 00:14:51,700
I have the ultimate power.

257
00:14:52,050 --> 00:14:55,640
And that gives you the right
to take over the world?

258
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:58,960
Did you hear that, Serizawa?
He's totally messed up in the head.

259
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,920
President...

260
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:03,130
You're so cool.

261
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:06,560
Absolute idiots are the worst to deal with!

262
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:09,090
I'm impressed with your attack earlier.

263
00:15:09,090 --> 00:15:11,350
The apple really doesn't
fall far from the tree.

264
00:15:11,350 --> 00:15:13,390
Don't lump me in with you!
How am I anything like you?!

265
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:16,350
You said you were charging
up energy for three months?

266
00:15:16,350 --> 00:15:18,930
I have the same ability.

267
00:15:19,110 --> 00:15:20,030
What?!

268
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:21,190
Didn't I tell you?

269
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:24,650
I spent twenty years preparing for this.

270
00:15:25,380 --> 00:15:28,860
Don't tell me that the last twenty years
wasn't to gather all those troops...

271
00:15:29,730 --> 00:15:33,460
I guess it wouldn't hurt to show you
some of my twenty years...

272
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:38,290
Why not give up already,

273
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:41,580
you poor souls the boss named the Scars?

274
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:42,120
Shut it!

275
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:46,740
You're a goddamn coward that doesn't
have to guts to go against the boss!

276
00:15:47,470 --> 00:15:51,470
The real reason he named you "Scars"
is because you're all failures.

277
00:15:51,770 --> 00:15:54,680
You were marked as damaged goods!

278
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:56,560
Screw you!

279
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:58,770
Telekinetic Helix!

280
00:16:00,410 --> 00:16:03,400
As for the basics required of espers...

281
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:06,820
we're on a entirely different level.

282
00:16:10,590 --> 00:16:12,380
I'm saying this for your own good.

283
00:16:12,990 --> 00:16:14,660
You should just give up.

284
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:23,210
But that manhole cover had
some effect, didn't it?

285
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:26,430
Teru-san!

286
00:16:26,430 --> 00:16:30,260
Yeah. It looks like attacks he didn't
detect actually work against him.

287
00:16:30,470 --> 00:16:33,970
He's the one who's been cornered here.

288
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:37,270
You're quite efficient.

289
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,710
Because of that,

290
00:16:41,010 --> 00:16:44,560
I'll get rid of you first, once and for all.

291
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:02,040
Not good. He's going to destroy him.

292
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:03,620
What can we do?

293
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:16,550
I believe it's time to end things.

294
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:18,850
Next, you'll come from behind!

295
00:17:18,990 --> 00:17:19,840
You—

296
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:22,810
It might be convenient to be able
to read your opponents' moves,

297
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:25,870
but that also makes your moves monotonous.

298
00:17:25,870 --> 00:17:27,810
You rely too much on your powers.

299
00:17:29,940 --> 00:17:31,630
Well, this is surprising.

300
00:17:31,630 --> 00:17:35,630
If we disregard the boss, I do have
the position as the world's greatest.

301
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:42,080
There are people in this world
with powers you can't even fathom.

302
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:46,790
You're just an ordinary man.
Even I could defeat you.

303
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:47,970
Why y—

304
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:50,380
You're right! It's when he's distracted!

305
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:52,460
Nice, Little Bro!

306
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:56,220
Fifth Punch!

307
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,600
Super Destructive Energy Blast!

308
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:11,650
I-I need to regain my...

309
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:20,030
C-Concentrate...

310
00:18:20,530 --> 00:18:23,490
Concentrate. Concentrate and you'll
be able to figure everything out.

311
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:28,210
Everyone here is an esper.
Cut everything else out.

312
00:18:28,210 --> 00:18:30,790
Concentrate. Concentrate.

313
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:33,090
Mind's Eye!

314
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:50,100
Nothing you can do will
ever work on me again.

315
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:53,520
Your injuries, the weaknesses
even you're not aware of,

316
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:55,230
and the fact that you can barely see now...

317
00:18:55,490 --> 00:18:58,130
I can see through everything now.

318
00:18:58,130 --> 00:19:00,340
It's too late to have any regrets.

319
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:06,600
What's the matter?

320
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:11,880
Something with tremendous
energy is heading this way.

321
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:14,590
Pretty sure that's my friend.

322
00:19:15,130 --> 00:19:16,540
I guess you finally woke up,

323
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,130
Kageyama-kun.

324
00:19:22,060 --> 00:19:23,640
How amusing.

325
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:27,600
Let's see whose abilities are greater!

326
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:31,060
I'll face you head-on!

327
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,400
Self-Defense Rush!

328
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:36,820
One of Reigen's special moves where,

329
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:41,450
Self-Defense Rush

330
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:41,450
when he's unsure if it's really self-defense,
he yells out "self-defense" just in case.

331
00:19:43,670 --> 00:19:46,370
Impossible! I couldn't sense him at all.

332
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,840
Who is he?!

333
00:19:48,550 --> 00:19:49,620
Reigen-san!

334
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:52,290
Everyone, get up! The great master is here.

335
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:55,250
The great master? Don't tell me...

336
00:19:55,410 --> 00:19:59,210
There's an esper who can actually
make his presence disappear?

337
00:19:59,540 --> 00:20:01,930
What should I do? Should I withdraw?

338
00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:05,110
Master, he's rather strong.

339
00:20:05,110 --> 00:20:07,180
He's dangerous, so please step back.

340
00:20:07,180 --> 00:20:08,340
Oh, hey, Mob.

341
00:20:07,460 --> 00:20:10,850
That boy from earlier and
this unknown esper...

342
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:12,530
Just how many are there?

343
00:20:12,530 --> 00:20:14,880
Do they have some kind of huge organization?

344
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:17,790
More importantly, this kid...
is on a whole other level.

345
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:24,370
Yeah, I give up.
I don't stand a chance. I give.

346
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:26,720
Well, that was easy.

347
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:29,080
What happened to taking over the world?

348
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:31,450
The only one serious about that is the boss.

349
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:34,150
I don't really care
as long as I get to have fun.

350
00:20:34,150 --> 00:20:35,920
As long as you get to have fun?

351
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:40,260
You disrupted the lives of
so many people just for that?

352
00:20:40,430 --> 00:20:41,590
You can't be serious.

353
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:45,720
He ran away!

354
00:20:46,810 --> 00:20:48,440
I don't feel like we won at all.

355
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:50,310
He might attack again.

356
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:53,270
No, I'm pretty sure he's been traumatized.

357
00:20:53,540 --> 00:20:57,430
I think he might've learned his place
and turned over a new leaf.

358
00:20:58,260 --> 00:20:59,210
Nii-san.

359
00:20:59,770 --> 00:21:01,820
Ritsu! Are you okay?

360
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:05,280
Yeah. Mom and Dad are somewhere safe, too.

361
00:21:05,700 --> 00:21:08,740
I see. So it's just like
Dimple and Master said.

362
00:21:08,950 --> 00:21:11,220
We sure had one hell of a scare.

363
00:21:11,220 --> 00:21:12,580
Shut up.

364
00:21:12,970 --> 00:21:15,790
Now, then... I guess all we
have left is the last boss.

365
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:18,920
Hoshino-kun and the others should be
getting people to safety right about now.

366
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,890
Let's meet back up with them and attack.

367
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:22,520
No.

368
00:21:23,230 --> 00:21:24,800
You're all hurt.

369
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:26,820
I'll go alone.

370
00:21:27,260 --> 00:21:30,220
K-Kageyama-kun! What are you talking about?!

371
00:21:30,540 --> 00:21:33,680
I'll go, too! One of my
friends already went in!

372
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,180
No.

373
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:38,150
This might be hard to hear,
but you'll just be in my way.

374
00:21:38,690 --> 00:21:39,490
I'm sorry.

375
00:21:40,060 --> 00:21:41,610
"Being hard on people"...

376
00:21:41,990 --> 00:21:45,570
So this is how Shigeo processed
what Mogami said to him.

377
00:21:46,550 --> 00:21:48,090
Dimple, I'm counting on you.

378
00:21:48,450 --> 00:21:50,030
I know!

379
00:22:04,610 --> 00:22:09,640
I spilled a seed and lost sight of it

380
00:22:13,350 --> 00:22:18,650
I'll find it using the color it's dyed in and watch it grow

381
00:22:20,990 --> 00:22:27,120
It immediately returned to the palm of my hand

382
00:22:27,120 --> 00:22:36,690
But it's still too light and too frail to reach for the skies

383
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:42,310
The world coldly drains away all the heat

384
00:22:42,310 --> 00:22:46,860
The bright sunshine just isn't enough

385
00:22:46,860 --> 00:22:51,250
The memories are closing off what lies ahead

386
00:22:51,250 --> 00:22:56,350
Shake off their warmth and set off into the distance

387
00:22:57,610 --> 00:23:03,110
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

388
00:23:03,110 --> 00:23:08,400
But my hope just doesn't fade away

389
00:23:24,900 --> 00:23:27,290
You're not scared to do this on your own?

390
00:23:27,290 --> 00:23:28,510
Of course I'm scared.

391
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:32,300
But having someone else get hurt
scares me even more.

392
00:23:32,300 --> 00:23:34,010
I'm sure I'll be able
to figure something out.

393
00:23:34,620 --> 00:23:37,930
Crap... I'm trying to take advantage
of him while he's still a kid,

394
00:23:38,220 --> 00:23:41,520
but Shigeo's going to become
an adult before I know it.

395
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:48,180
Are you in middle school?
Damn... You're still a kid.

396
00:23:48,490 --> 00:23:51,200
This is a really bad time.

397
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:54,020
Would you kindly leave?

398
00:23:55,590 --> 00:23:57,410
Mob finally infiltrates the enemy's base.

399
00:23:57,410 --> 00:24:00,000
Can he get past Serizawa
and make it to the boss?

400
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:03,040
Meanwhile, the boss, who just defeated
his son, Sho, shows his true identity.

401
00:24:03,230 --> 00:24:05,130
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 12:

402
00:24:05,290 --> 00:24:06,960
"The Battle for Social Rehabilitation
~Friendship~."

403
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:10,170
The serious option C involves
Blu-rays, manga volumes, and events!

404
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:10,210
The Battle for Social Rehabilitation
~Friendship~
